d by the match finder. It has a minimum value of ZSTD_MINMATCH_MIN.\n271: *    - ZSTD_c_compressionLevel accordingly adjusts the strength of the entropy coder, as it would in typical compression.\n272: *    - ZSTD_c_windowLog affects offset validation: this function will return an error at higher debug levels if a provided offset\n317: * ranging from ZSTD_MAGIC_SKIPPABLE_START to ZSTD_MAGIC_SKIPPABLE_START+15.\n319: * so the magic number used will be ZSTD_MAGIC_SKIPPABLE_START + magicVariant.\n334: * i.e. magicNumber - ZSTD_MAGIC_SKIPPABLE_START.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
